+      ' RenderThread-2978  ( 2794) [002] dN.1 62828.421805: ' +
+        'ipi_entry: (Rescheduling interrupts)',
+      ' RenderThread-2978  ( 2794) [002] dN.1 62828.421809: ' +
+        'ipi_exit: (Rescheduling interrupts)'
