+      'Binder_8-1735  ( 1022) [001] ...1  1735.472240: mm_vmscan_direct_reclaim_begin: order=3 may_writepage=1 gfp_flags=GFP_KERNEL|GFP_NOWARN|0x2', // @suppress longLineCheck
